# Fennel: Fennel reference (fennel-lang.org/reference); requirements/languages/fennel.md
name     fennel fnl
keyword  fn lambda λ let local var set global if when unless do while for each match case collect icollect
keyword  accumulate macro macros import-macros require-macros include values pick-values
builtin  true false nil print require tostring tonumber ipairs pairs table string math
ident-extra    !?*<>=/+-
ident-part     !?*<>=/+-.:
line-comment   ;
string   " "  : escapes multiline
sigil    :    : attr
call-after-paren
